Changes from QuickTiles 1.8, made by dhevdotdev starting
2026-11-01. The git history records every change and its date.

- Renamed the app to Tile Shelf with the application id and Kotlin
  package com.tileshelf.app, and replaced the launcher icon.
- Rewrote the screens in Jetpack Compose with Material 3 Expressive,
  including the tile catalog, the grants flow and the about screen.
- Added the Clear clipboard, Mute media, Auto-sync, Switch keyboard
  and Wireless debugging tiles, web links for the custom tiles, and
  the system add-tile prompt.
- Replaced the root-only wireless debugging tile with one that uses
  the WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS grant on Android 11 and later.
- Removed the old settings screens, the translations, the store
  listings and the GitLab CI configuration.

